  <div>
    <strong>David Hampian · Field Vision</strong>
      <p>David Hampian is the founder and fractional CMO of Field Vision, a growth consultancy for fandom brands and content apps in music, sports, gaming, and streaming. He was the first growth marketing hire at Pandora, which he helped grow to over 80 million monthly active users, Senior Director of Global Integrated Marketing at Twitch, VP of Brand and Go-to-Market at Hard Rock International, where he launched Hard Rock Bet, and Global Head of Audience Development at Amazon across Amazon Music, Audible, Twitch, and Prime Video. Based in the San Francisco Bay Area.</p>
